venv
*/output/

# Large model weight files — externalized to the content-addressed store
# (../video_generation__models/<md5>.safetensors). In-tree model dirs hold
# symlinks into that store; real weights are reproducible (convert.py /
# download) and must never be committed. Symlinks that must be tracked are
# force-added (`git add -f`); gitignore does not untrack already-tracked files.
*.safetensors

# Slow tokenizer fallback (not needed at runtime)
**/models/tokenizer/merges.txt
**/models/tokenizer/vocab.json
